{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、年度末〜〜！！！\n毎日毎日目まぐるしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動とかも決まったりする頃なのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも一緒に頑張りましょう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握@京都"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は久しぶりの全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブも久しぶりだし\n君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな\nを初披露しました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにレーンはかずみさんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くほっこりして\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恐縮ながらアメイジングも\n何回かやらせて貰ったよ〜！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またペアになれたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おに魂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願のNACK5に出させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！！！\n本当に嬉しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉といえばNACK5！！！\nいつも聴いてたNACK5！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前からかなり緊張していたのですが、\n本番もしっかり緊張してテンパってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったし\nとてもいい経験になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッタバタな放送でしたが、\n聴いてくれてありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バカボンさんも優里さんも若月さんも\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお邪魔したいな〜〜(^_−)−☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてラジオ関係でもう一つ、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この度、\nbayFMにてレギュラーラジオ\nOL兼任アイドル・新内眞衣の\nまいちゅんカフェを\nやらせて頂くことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの1人喋りです、、、！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルが集う秘密のカフェ。\n日頃のアイドルやOLのお仕事から\n解放されて本音が言える唯一の場所\n店長は私、新内眞衣。\n夜遅くですがカフェで寛ぎませんか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってな感じでして、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆる〜い感じの番組にしていきたいと\n思ってます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間帯は\n毎週水曜日 0時〜0時30分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初回放送日は4月1日です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに番組では\n様々な意見や質問も募集しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールアドレスは\nmytune@bayfm.co.jp"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お便りじゃんじゃん\nお待ちしております！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の単独番組。\nそして初のレギュラー。\n本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く凄く緊張してますが、\n少しでも成長出来るように\n頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんカフェ何卒\nよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/22/3084865/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で\nおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新しますm(_ _)m"}],"source":"archive"}